plicity and note the residence time is 50 min. Or adjust flow to 0.167 mL/min. Let's use 0.167 mL/min to hit 30 min. But 0.167 is not a round number. Let's use 0.1 mL/min and residence time 50 min. This is safer. Let's update residence_time_min to 50.\", \"residence_time_in_channel_min\": \"Same as inlet for packed bed.\", \"light_setup\": \"Not applicable for hydrogenation.\", \"wavelength_nm\": \"Not applicable.\", \"streams\": \"Stream A is the liquid reactant. Stream B is the hydrogen gas.\", \"mixer_type\": \"Certified gas-liquid mixer from inventory.\", \"mixing_order_reasoning\": \"Mixing before the reactor ensures saturation.\", \"pre_reactor_steps\": \"Standard setup for flow hydrogenation.\", \"post_reactor_steps\": \"Standard workup and analysis.\", \"chemistry_notes\": \"See above.\", \"stage_parameters\": \"See above.\", \"reasoning_per_field\": \"See above.\", \"literature_analogies\": \"Flow hydrogenation of benzyl ethers/esters is well-documented. Azetidinols are less common but follow similar kinetics.\", \"engine_validated\": true, \"safety_flags\": [\"Hydrogen is flammable. Ensure all connections are tight and system is purged.\", \"Pd(OH)2/Al2O3 is a pyrophoric catalyst when dry. Keep wet.\", \"Pressure relief is provided by BPR.\"], \"confidence\": 0.8}"
